# ry_cg_half — Ry(arccos(⅓)/2) (Schur-Weyl CG 반각; HE2 T1 승인 module). CCRy(arccos⅓)=CCX·half†·CCX·half 분해용(√⅔·√⅓ CG mixing). Ry(α)=YPowGate(exponent=α/π) up-to-phase(C4). analytic golden.
```python id=bloq
import numpy as np
from qualtran.bloqs.basic_gates import YPowGate
bloq = YPowGate(exponent=float(np.arccos(1.0/3.0) / (2.0*np.pi)))
```
```python id=golden
import numpy as np
a = np.arccos(1.0/3.0) / 2.0
golden = np.array([[np.cos(a/2), -np.sin(a/2)], [np.sin(a/2), np.cos(a/2)]], dtype=complex)
```
